{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115094","id":3185350367,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc693Jbf","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115094","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115094.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115094.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115094","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115094/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115094/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115094/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a59ce34e1968830ba42e935d54fd465822d458cd","number":115094,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Take lifetime randomness into account when calculating lifetime value","user":{"login":"Flynsarmy","id":334808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDgwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy","html_url":"https://github.com/Flynsarmy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113321\r\n\r\nPrevious behavior: `CUSTOM.y` tracked the age relative to the system `LIFETIME`, but didn't account for the individual particle's reduced `params.lifetime` due to randomness. This meant `lifetime_percent` was incorrect for particles with randomized lifetimes.\r\n\r\nNew behavior: `CUSTOM.y` now tracks the normalized age of the particle (0.0 to 1.0), accounting for its specific randomized lifetime.\r\n\r\nThe dependent calculations were also updated to use the new normalized `CUSTOM.y` correctly.\r\n\r\nMake sure you delete your cache before testing as the shader will need a recompile.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e312c3e6-4a8f-44f9-a160-42989ed7b313\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-01-18T13:48:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T15:19:49Z","closed_at":"2026-01-19T15:11:31Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b8a95cf2b30f82534885f9cbf70997de58f47f54","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","fo